### Specification (Dynamic WHERE clause)
```java
public class UserSpec {
    public static Specification<User> hasName(String name) {
        return (root, q, cb) -> name == null ? null : cb.like(root.get("name"), "%" + name + "%");
    }
    public static Specification<User> hasDept(String dept) {
        return (root, q, cb) -> dept == null ? null : cb.equal(root.get("dept"), dept);
    }
}
// Usage:
Page<User> users = repo.findAll(
    Specification.where(UserSpec.hasName(name)).and(UserSpec.hasDept(dept)),
    PageRequest.of(0, 20, Sort.by("name")));
```

